        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Killeely More, Kilcolgan, Co. Galway, H91APY7\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGohery Properties are delighted to bring to the market this beautiful 5 bed detached family home located close to the centre of Kilcolgan village, adjacent to restaurants, shops, transport links and with easy access to motorways for Ennis, Shannon, Galway and close to Clarinbridge, beautiful scenic walks. This delightful home was built in 1971 and maintained in excellent condition. The property offers an excellent opportunity to move to this sought after location - a ready to walk into home which offers the benefit of a detached “garden apartment” to the rear of the dwelling The dwelling currently comprises main entrance hall, main reception, kitchen dining conservatory, office, bed 1, bed2, main bathroom, first floor – 3 bedrooms, all ensuite The property has the benefit of double-glazed PVC windows, oil fired central heating, modern kitchen and bathrooms and a south facing rear garden – The garden apartment comprises open plan living kitchen dining, 3 bedrooms and bathroom, Oil heating.\r\n\r\n5-bedroom 4-bathroom property\r\nOil central heating system\r\nExtends to 234 sq mts ( 2,520 sq.ft.) accommodation\r\nDetached “garden apartment” to rear of dwelling\r\nRare opportunity to acquire a strong detached in a country location yet so close to Kilcolgan facilities\r\nSite area 0.12 ha (0.3 acres)\r\nOranmore has easy access to both Galway City & Motorway access to all routes"
      },
